# Stay Hidden, Stay Silent on Bot2's Ornithopter: "When this Aura enters, tap enchanted creature" taps it on turn 3, and "Enchanted
# creature doesn't untap during its controller's untap step" (CR 502.3) keeps it tapped through Bot2's turn-4 untap step. On turn 5,
# with a spell on the stack the {4}{U}{U} ability is refused ("Activate only as a sorcery", CR 602.5d), and with the stack empty it
# resolves: the Ornithopter is shuffled into Bot2's library (Bot2's library is shuffled once, one card bigger) and Bot1 manifests
# dread - of Llanowar Elves and Lightning Bolt the Elves goes face down as a 2/2 and the Bolt to the graveyard. The Aura, its
# creature gone, goes to the graveyard (CR 704.5m).

